{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Nomad Translator》是一款專為旅行及日常溝通而設的離線翻譯工具，適合網絡緩慢、昂貴或無法使用的環境。它支援文字、語音及相片翻譯，涵蓋菜單、路牌、對話、的士、酒店、機場與訊息等常見場景。現正限時免費，原價 US $14.99。</p>\n\n<h2>離線文字語音相片翻譯</h2>\n<p>這款 App 專為真實旅行場景而設，即使沒有網絡或訊號不穩，也能快速完成文字、語音及相片翻譯。所有處理均在裝置上進行，保障私隱，操作介面簡潔易用。下載一次後，無論查看路牌、菜單、對話，還是酒店與機場資訊，都能隨時離線使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-275-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-276-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-277-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-278-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2064x2752bb-68-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2064x2752bb-69-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Nomad Translator – No Internet</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.244216+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}